  The reel_script and slides say the ruling party MLA was arrested and that Edappadi Palaniswami 'welcomed' the arrest, which is broadly consistent, but the draft adds 'the investigation continues' (slides_spec: 'வழக்கின் விசாரணை தொடர்கிறது') which is not stated in the article.
